WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.499 --> 00:00:04.668
(Luwin): As word of King Aerys'
erratic and troubling behavior

00:00:04.669 --> 00:00:07.129
spread throughout the Seven Kingdoms,

00:00:07.130 --> 00:00:10.841
Lord Rickard Stark
continued to serve his king faithfully

00:00:10.842 --> 00:00:13.385
as Warden of the North.

00:00:13.386 --> 00:00:15.637
The proud father of four children,

00:00:15.638 --> 00:00:19.725
his daughter Lyanna
was engaged to Robert Baratheon,

00:00:19.726 --> 00:00:23.353
the young lord of Storm's End.

00:00:23.354 --> 00:00:27.524
Centuries of peace
between the North and the Iron Throne

00:00:27.525 --> 00:00:32.070
ended the day Rhaegar Targaryen,
Prince of Dragonstone,

00:00:32.071 --> 00:00:34.615
abducted Lyanna.

00:00:34.616 --> 00:00:38.660
Enraged, Brandon Stark
rode to King's Landing

00:00:38.661 --> 00:00:40.913
demanding the release of his sister

00:00:40.914 --> 00:00:43.832
and the death of Rhaegar.

00:00:43.833 --> 00:00:47.211
Aerys arrested him for treason

00:00:47.212 --> 00:00:48.587
and called his father

00:00:48.588 --> 00:00:51.632
to come to the capital to ransom him.

00:00:51.633 --> 00:00:53.050
When Lord Rickard complied,

00:00:53.051 --> 00:00:58.051
Aerys, now utterly mad,
arrested him for treason as well.

00:00:58.765 --> 00:01:02.476
Lord Rickard demanded a trial by combat.

00:01:02.477 --> 00:01:06.563
Aerys declared fire
the champion of House Targaryen

00:01:06.564 --> 00:01:09.942
and had Lord Rickard suspended
from the rafters of the throne room

00:01:09.943 --> 00:01:13.320
while pyromancers lit a blaze beneath him.

00:01:13.321 --> 00:01:15.072
As he burned,

00:01:15.073 --> 00:01:17.741
Brandon was brought into the throne room,

00:01:17.742 --> 00:01:22.742
a leather cord attached to a strangulation
device was wrapped around his neck.

00:01:23.331 --> 00:01:27.209
Aerys told Brandon
his father was a dead man...

00:01:27.210 --> 00:01:30.087
but there was a chance to save him.

00:01:30.088 --> 00:01:34.299
A longsword was placed on the floor
just out of Brandon's reach.

00:01:34.300 --> 00:01:36.218
And the more he struggled to reach it,

00:01:36.219 --> 00:01:39.930
the more the cord tightened 
around his throat.

00:01:39.931 --> 00:01:42.766
Brandon Stark strangled himself,

00:01:42.767 --> 00:01:45.102
trying to free his father...

00:01:45.103 --> 00:01:49.565
who was roasted alive in his own armor.

00:01:49.566 --> 00:01:54.566
The entire court stood
and watched this atrocity take place...

00:01:55.405 --> 00:01:59.658
Ser Jaime Lannister and the Kingsguard
among them.

00:01:59.659 --> 00:02:03.203
The Mad King was reported
to have laughed hysterically

00:02:03.204 --> 00:02:08.204
as these two noble men were tortured
and brutally killed before him.

00:02:09.460 --> 00:02:13.046
Seeking to rid the world
of all his supposed enemies,

00:02:13.047 --> 00:02:17.593
Aerys called for the head
of Rickard's youngest son, Eddard Stark,

00:02:17.594 --> 00:02:21.346
and Lyanna's betrothed -
Robert Baratheon.

00:02:21.347 --> 00:02:23.223
He sent word to Lord Jon Arryn -

00:02:23.224 --> 00:02:25.350
who had fostered
both young men at the Eyrie -

00:02:25.351 --> 00:02:26.810
to apprehend them.

00:02:26.811 --> 00:02:28.061
Instead...

00:02:28.062 --> 00:02:33.062
Lord Arryn joined Houses Stark
and Baratheon in rebellion.

00:02:33.318 --> 00:02:35.986
Robert vowed to kill Rhaegar Targaryen

00:02:35.987 --> 00:02:40.987
and get his beloved Lyanna back.

